# Compiled GtkBuilder UI. Source is components/ui/*.xml and components/ui/settings/*.xml;
# `make` runs `xmllint --xinclude` into this directory. The files stay tracked because
# the app loads them at runtime. jscpd (copy/paste detection in CI) reads .gitignore
# by default, and the shared CICD workflow overwrites .github/linters/.jscpd.json, so
# this is how those generated copies are excluded from duplication checks.
d_fake_seeder/components/ui/generated/

